                           <p>Script: Handwritten dbu can.<lb/>Title in dbu med on the cover page.<lb/>Volume letter in the margin: ka<lb/>Missing folio: fol. 19.<lb/>No folio number on the last folio, which follows fol. 80.<lb/>Lines per folio: 7.<lb/>Note in dbu med on top of fol. 27a.</p>
