The dates 1227-1305 are known from the biography (see work (ID:7016)) composed by his student bSam gtan bzang po (ID:4005) ([KHA9ZVGP]: 3).&#13;
His name in religion was Dar ma rgyal mtshan or Chos kyi rgyal mtshan ([FZ6N88AU]: 406) - the name Chos kyi rgyal mtshan is given as his "real name" (mtshan dngos) in a homage by Rong ston ([KM47ZZDJ]: 657 and n. 62). &#13;
The majority of the colophons of his works name him "bCom ldan ral gri," a few "Rigs/Rig pa’i ral gri" or just "Ral gri." Schwabland's discussion of the variants “Rigs pa” and “Rig pa” does not come to a definite conclusion as to which is the correct spelling ([CTQMVBPR]: 2-3).&#13;
He was born as the son of a local wealthy headman, the fourth of five sons and his birth is reported to have been foretold by Śākyaśrībhadra (ID:6418) when he was invited by Ral gri's paternal uncle ([KHA9ZVGP]: 3).</note></person><person xml:id="person4052"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">skyo ston smon lam tshul khrims</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">སྐྱོ་སྟོན་སྨོན་ལམ་ཚུལ་ཁྲིམས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bla ma snar thang pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bla ma snar thang pa brgyad pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">slob dpon pad ma</persName><birth notBefore="1219-01-01" notAfter="1219-12-31">1219</birth><death notBefore="1299-01-01" notAfter="1299-12-31">1299</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1219</idno><idno type="APIS">4052</idno></person><person xml:id="person4062"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">skyi ston shAkya 'bum</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">སྐྱི་སྟོན་ཤཱཀྱ་འབུམ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">skyi ston shag 'bum</persName><birth notBefore="1200-01-01" notAfter="1200-12-31">1200</birth><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P5741</idno><idno type="APIS">4062</idno></person><person xml:id="person4128"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa bzang ma ti paN chen blo gros rgyal mtshan</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ས་བཟང་མ་ཏི་པཎ་ཆེན་བློ་གྲོས་རྒྱལ་མཚན</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bod kyi paNDita ma ti rha ja shri bha dra</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bod kyi pandita 'jam dbyangs blo gros</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sa bzang 'phags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan</persName><birth notBefore="1294-01-01" notAfter="1294-12-31">1294</birth><death notBefore="1376-01-01" notAfter="1376-12-31">13